026/05/02/MIYWCMZRMQ4DGYLDHBRDCMBRMY/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Sales have increased, but the stock price is 'plummeting'... Big Pharma's growth slows down due to patent expiration and pressure on generic drugs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/science/2026/05/02/MIYWCMZRMQ4DGYLDHBRDCMBRMY/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;매출 늘었는데 주가 ‘뚝’...특허 만료·복제약 압박에 빅파마 성장 주춤&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/MJRTSNRRGNQWEZBXGI4DOZJQMY.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/market_trend/2026/05/02/ME3GINRVGFSGKMJZGIZDIYRUME/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;[Today's Wine] A golden end to the perfect dinner... 10 years of João Pires Moscatel de Setubal&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/market_trend/2026/05/02/ME3GINRVGFSGKMJZGIZDIYRUME/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;[오늘의 와인] 완벽한 만찬을 위한 황금빛 마침표… 주앙 피레스 모스카텔 드 세투발 10년&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/G42WIYJZMNQTENBRGA4DAYRYGU.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/realty/investment_trends/2026/05/02/GNQWMOBZGVSTKOBUMYZDOMRYGM/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;"Samsung men don't live"... 210,000 semiconductor jobs The grim reality of Pyeongtaek&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/realty/investment_trends/2026/05/02/GNQWMOBZGVSTKOBUMYZDOMRYGM/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;"삼성맨은 살지 않는다"…반도체 일자리 21만개 평택의 암울한 현실&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/F6KOKTD2Y6OMWRBL7XU4UUQFXA.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/GE3TIMLCGBRGCNJUGNSDIOJSGU/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Even the government should not see VC as good and PE as evil&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/GE3TIMLCGBRGCNJUGNSDIOJSGU/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;[데스크 칼럼] 정부마저 VC는 선, PE는 악으로 봐선 안된다&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/GFSGKNDDMQYTCZRZGAZTCMRRGI.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/market_trend/2026/05/02/G5SDQOBVHEZDSYJSMQZGCNDCMM/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;'1 trillion department stores with sales' outside Seoul will increase... Lotte Incheon and Shinsegae Gwangju as the next candidates&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/market_trend/2026/05/02/G5SDQOBVHEZDSYJSMQZGCNDCMM/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;서울 밖 ‘매출 1兆 백화점’ 늘어난다… 롯데 인천·신세계 광주, 차기 후보로&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/HEZWCYLFGRSWGOBTG5RTEZTGGQ.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/tech_it/2026/05/02/GNSDIYRYMI2GCMJWGQ2GIZRXGY/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;[Interview] Amikai Ron, Senior Vice President of TI, "AI Battlefield, Moving from Cloud to Devices" &lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/tech_it/2026/05/02/GNSDIYRYMI2GCMJWGQ2GIZRXGY/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;[인터뷰] 아미카이 론 TI 수석부사장 “AI 전쟁터, 클라우드서 기기 안으로 이동” &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/MNSGMZLCME2TIYJWHA2TKZRZMY.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/realty/realestate_news/2026/05/02/GBTGCOLFMVRTEZLCGQ2TQMBSGA/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;"Fix and fix again... Real estate measures are exactly like the process of plastic surgery and ruining."&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/realty/realestate_news/2026/05/02/GBTGCOLFMVRTEZLCGQ2TQMBSGA/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;"고치고 또 고치고…부동산 대책, 성형 망하는 과정과 꼭 닮아"&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/GU2DEZRWGE3TEMZVMQYWGZBWGE.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/stock-finance/2026/05/02/HE2GEODDGEZDIOJZMU4TQOJYGI/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;"Should I change all my equipment"... Financial security struggles due to 'Mythos shock'&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/stock-finance/2026/05/02/HE2GEODDGEZDIOJZMU4TQOJYGI/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;“장비 전부 바꿔야 하나”… ‘미토스 쇼크’에 금융권 보안 고심&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/GE3DOMLCGNRWINJYMM3TGYJTME.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/GY2TGN3DGE4TENJUMUYGKYRXGM/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;[Sejong Insideout] Major government policy, it turns out that 'Lee Jae-myung's Gyeonggi Province Fair Bureau' is the aid&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/GY2TGN3DGE4TENJUMUYGKYRXGM/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;[세종 인사이드아웃] 정부 주요 정책, 알고 보니 ‘이재명 경기도 공정국’이 원조&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/G5TGIMZWG4YDAYZWGQ2GCNRZGI.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/stock-finance/2026/05/02/MVSTOZRVGZSWGYJXGFTDAZRRMQ/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Semiconductor stocks are severely focused, and there are concerns about increased volatility in the Korean stock market... Gains slow after earnings announcement&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/stock-finance/2026/05/02/MVSTOZRVGZSWGYJXGFTDAZRRMQ/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;반도체주 쏠림 심한 韓 증시 변동성 확대 우려... 실적 발표 이후 상승세 둔화&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/GQZWIMTBHA3TKZJRMYZTCYJZGI.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/industry-company/2026/05/02/GUYWGZLDGAYWKNZUG5TDMNBWGU/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Stable off-road, smooth downtown line... Evolved Defender Octa Black &lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/industry-company/2026/05/02/GUYWGZLDGAYWKNZUG5TDMNBWGU/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;[시승기] 오프로드에선 안정적, 도심선 부드럽게… 진화한 디펜더 옥타 블랙 &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/GEZTIYLFHEYGMMZXGI3DQNTCG4.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/real_estate/2026/05/02/GI2TSNJWGZRWIN3DHAZWEZBQMU/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Apartment without playground?... Let's install other facilities when the local 'baby crying' disappears&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/real_estate/2026/05/02/GI2TSNJWGZRWIN3DHAZWEZBQMU/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;놀이터 없는 아파트?… 지방 ‘아기 울음’ 사라지자 다른 시설 설치하자&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/MNQWIYZQMI2TOYLFMJQTEYJTG4.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/realty/redevelop/2026/05/02/HEYTGYZYMEZGKZRYHA4TGZTBG4/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;The magic of Buyoung, where 300 billion won land is 5 trillion... Construction of the 8-year-old Buyeong Hotel land